OL,3,GNEWSARed weather warning issued for
OL,4,Acoastal overtopping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA red weather warning has been issued
OL,7,Ffor the Isle of Man for large waves
OL,8,Fcrashing onto coastal roads.
OL,10,FIt is in place for coastal overtopping
OL,11,Ffrom 22:00 until 01:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,13,FA red warning is rare and means extreme
OL,14,Fconditions are likely, with a risk to
OL,15,Flife, as well as possible widespread
OL,16,Fdamage, travel disruption and
OL,17,Finterruptions to power and
OL,18,Fcommunications.
OL,20,FThe government has asked people to take
OL,21,Fthe "warning seriously and avoid
OL,22,Faffected coastal areas."
